# Parity cases that legitimately reach an ambient-nondeterministic host builtin
# (time / random_int / random_float), having turned the value into an assertion
# that IS a function of the program. Format: <case> <reason>
#
# Checked by scripts/determinism_check.sh. An entry whose case no longer calls
# one is an error, so this list cannot outlive its reason.
time_clock asserts only structure (epoch > 2020-01-01, second read >= first), never a value
file_exists_random_int asserts only structure (a draw from 6 is in range, a draw from 1 is 0, a bound of 0 is refused), never a drawn value
